<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Reset-->
  <VREStarjack_Reset>重置</VREStarjack_Reset>
  <!--EN: This ability can only be used while in orbit-->
  <VRE_AbilityOnlyInSpace>此能力只能在轨道上使用</VRE_AbilityOnlyInSpace>
  <!--EN: Astrogenes-->
  <VRE_Astrogenes>星状基因</VRE_Astrogenes>
  <!--EN: Astrogenes are special genetic mutations that only become active in orbit. They don't count towards complexity and metabolism of the gene carrier, but they have no effect on the surface of a planet.-->
  <VRE_AstrogenesDesc>星状基因是一种特殊的基因突变，仅在轨道上活跃。它们不计入基因载体的复杂性和新陈代谢，但它们对行星表面没有影响。</VRE_AstrogenesDesc>
  <!--EN: Number of Starjack Genes:-->
  <VRE_StarjackGenes>星杰克基因数量：</VRE_StarjackGenes>
  <!--EN: By default, Starjacks will spawn with 2 Astrogenes. With this you can make the spawn with anything from 0 to 5 Astrogenes. This will obviously not affect already existing Starjacks!-->
  <VRE_StarjackGenesDesc>默认情况下，Starjacks 会生成 2 个 Astrogenes。有了这个，你可以用 0 到 5 个 Astrogenes 的任何东西来生成生成物。这显然不会影响已经存在的 Starjack！</VRE_StarjackGenesDesc>
</LanguageData>
